+# scale at [288, 292) and 12B of 16B-alignment pad (304B stride):
+#
+#     [  0, 256)  packed E2M1 latent (512 x 4-bit, 32 group-16 blocks)
+#     [256, 288)  32 x E4M3 group scale bytes
