+    ``traits.kv_gmem_stride`` straight through and is then AUTHORITATIVE. When
+    it is omitted the stride follows ``latent_scale_per_token`` exactly the way
+    ``make_unified_traits`` derives it (288 without the per-token fp32 latent
+    scale, 304 with it), so the device geometry can never drift from the trait
+    that sized the cache.
